    "description": "<p>Whenever you successfully attack with a weapon whose <strong data-start=\"2700\" data-end=\"2787\">range differs from the range of the weapon used for your previous successful attack</strong>, gain a <strong data-start=\"2796\" data-end=\"2817\">Tactical Die (d6)</strong>.</p><p data-start=\"2820\" data-end=\"2885\">You can hold a number of Tactical Dice equal to your Proficiency.</p><p data-start=\"2887\" data-end=\"3028\">You can spend a Tactical Die to add its result to an attack or damage roll made with a weapon.</p><p data-start=\"3030\" data-end=\"3120\">At the end of each session, clear your Tactical Dice and gain a Hope for each die cleared.</p>",
